    {
     "who": "penrose",
     "text": "Ah - the Commission's engineer. Arthur Penrose. Forgive the noise; the Skyhook is warming her feet tonight."
    },
    {
     "who": "penrose",
     "text": "Routine maintenance. Tuesdays are quiet. Is there anything I can show you?"
